{
  "doc_id": "13281-2008-gbt-e-300",
  "doc_name": "unknown_title",
  "language": "zh",
  "units": [
    {
      "unit_id": 0,
      "text": "犐犆犛29.220.20犓84犌犅／犜13281-2008代替ＧＢ／Ｔ13281-199120080613发布20090301实施发布前　　言本标准代替ＧＢ／Ｔ13281-1991《铁路客车用铅酸蓄电池》.",
      "type": "other",
      "level": 0,
      "parent_id": null,
      "unit_hash": "md5:61c8d575ce92aa2951790515536f6f97"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 1,
      "text": "犐犆犛29.220.20犓84犌犅／犜13281-2008代替ＧＢ／Ｔ13281-199120080613发布20090301实施发布前　　言本标准代替ＧＢ／Ｔ13281-1991《铁路客车用铅酸蓄电池》.\n本标准与原ＧＢ／Ｔ13281-1991相比主要变化如下：\n采用阀控式铅酸蓄电池的有关技术要求和试验方法.\n---增加了术语、符号---增加了产品分类及环境要求---增加了开路电压一致性---增加了容量一致性---增加了低温容量---增加了大电流放电特性---增加过充电性能---增加密封反应效率---增加防爆能力---增加防酸雾能力---增加排气阀性能---增加气密性---修改荷电保持能力---修改循环耐久能力---取消封口剂性能试验本标准由中国电器工业协会提出.\n本标准由全国铅酸蓄电池标准化技术委员会(ＳＡＣ／ＴＣ69)归口.\n本标准主要起草单位：沈阳蓄电池研究所、浙江古越蓄电池有限公司、丰日电气集团股份有限公司.\n本标准主要起草人：谢爽、曹苗根、宋永江、赵键、彭建辉.\n---ＪＢ1864-76、ＧＢ／Ｔ13281-1991.\nⅠ犌犅／犜13281-2008",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 1,
      "parent_id": 0,
      "unit_hash": "md5:8c8933a1e215602e1fe8ea4fe07e813f"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 2,
      "text": "1　范围\n装、运输和贮存.\n本标准适用于铁路客车照明及其他电器直流电源用的铅酸蓄电池(以下简称蓄电池).",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "parent_id": 0,
      "unit_hash": "md5:82dd9dbdab1ce592ecb776638025d83e",
      "num_prefix": "1",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 3,
      "text": "2　规范性引用文件\n下列文件中的条款通过本标准的引用而成为本标准的条款.凡是注日期的引用文件，其随后所有的修改单(不包括勘误的内容)或修订版均不适用于本标准，然而，鼓励根据本标准达成协议的各方研究是否可使用这些文件的最新版本.凡是不注日期的引用文件，其最新版本适用于本标准.\nＪＢ／Ｔ2599　铅酸蓄电池产品型号编制方法",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "parent_id": 0,
      "unit_hash": "md5:5c900bd7afe900d20aea2065450fa11f",
      "num_prefix": "2",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 4,
      "text": "3　术语、符号\n3.1在规定条件下测得的并由制造商宣称的电池的容量值.本标准10小时率(以下用10ｈｒ表示)容量用犆10(Ａｈ)表示、5小时率(以下用5ｈｒ表示)容量用犆5(Ａｈ)表示、1小时率(以下用1ｈｒ表示)容量用犆1(Ａｈ)表示.数值见表1.\n3.2在规定的条件下测得的蓄电池实际所能放出的电量；本标准用犆ａ(Ａｈ)表示.\n3.3在-40℃的低温条件下测得的蓄电池实际所能放出的电量；本标准用犆ｄ(Ａｈ)表示.\n3.410犺狉电流、5犺狉电流、1犺狉电流　10、5、1犺狅狌狉狉犪狋犲犮狌狉狉犲狀狋表示蓄电池充放电电流大小的术语，其数值见表1.本标准用犐10(Ａ)、犐5(Ａ)、犐1(Ａ)表示.\n3.5在规定条件下，蓄电池内部水分分解产生的气体通过负极吸收还原成水的效率；本标准用η(％)表示.\n3.6在规定条件下，2只或2只以上2Ｖ或12Ｖ单只蓄电池串联使用过程中的端电压一致性的显示状态.本标准用Δ犝(Ｖ)表示.\n犌犅／犜13281-2008在规定条件下，2只或2只以上2Ｖ或12Ｖ单只蓄电池串联使用过程中容量一致性的显示状态.\n本标准用Δ犆(Ａｈ)表示.\n3.7由多个隔室构成的整体蓄电池的每个隔室称单体蓄电池.\n3.8蓄电池在通常的过充电条件下排气阀阻止外部火源点燃内部气体的能力.\n3.9蓄电池内部是否含有金属镉、镉氧化物及镉盐的明示.",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "parent_id": 0,
      "unit_hash": "md5:8a706328202b76394bf5c2902c688814",
      "num_prefix": "3",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 5,
      "text": "4　产品规格、外形及连接尺寸",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "parent_id": 0,
      "unit_hash": "md5:2c97e6610eb53b49c49daf73a9f32b91",
      "num_prefix": "4",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 6,
      "text": "4.1　产品规格型号与尺寸(见表1).\n表1　蓄电池基本参数蓄电池型号额定电压／Ｖ最大质量／ｋｇ10ｈｒ放电5ｈｒ放电1ｈｒ放电犐10／Ａ额定容量／Ａ.ｈ终止电压／Ｖ犐5／Ａ额定容量／Ａ.ｈ终止电压／Ｖ犐1／Ａ额定容量／Ａ.ｈ终止电压／Ｖ长宽总高6ＴＭ4012.0016.004.0010.806.6010.5024.0010.201986ＴＭ6012.0026.006.0010.8010.0010.5036.0010.202656ＴＭ9012.0040.009.00\n10.8017.0010.5065.0010.204076ＴＭ12012.0040.0012.0012010.8020.0010010.5072.0010.204106ＴＭ20012.0073.0020.0020010.8033.3016710.50120.0012010.20520ＴＭ4502.0039.0045.004501.8077.003851.75270.002701.70",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 2,
      "parent_id": 5,
      "unit_hash": "md5:ef7afac68ce108f3beb89fddc27d2edf",
      "num_prefix": "4.1",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 7,
      "text": "4.2　产品型号编制按ＪＢ／Ｔ2599.用汉字“铁”拼音的第一个大写字母“Ｔ”表示.具体命名见图1：\n例如：\n6ＴＭ10ｈｒ图1　产品型号命名",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 2,
      "parent_id": 5,
      "unit_hash": "md5:672874ca9875e11416ba5618245067a7",
      "num_prefix": "4.2",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 8,
      "text": "4.3　外形和连接尺寸\n蓄电池外形和连接尺寸见图2所示.\n犌犅／犜13281-2008图2　外形和连接尺寸",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "parent_id": 5,
      "unit_hash": "md5:3c33f6486ed5fbe69eb42ff70d75d1cf",
      "num_prefix": "4.3",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 9,
      "text": "5　环境要求和技术要求",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "parent_id": 0,
      "unit_hash": "md5:e08ed9ebca2660f23c2c22025e00d74d",
      "num_prefix": "5",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 10,
      "text": "5.1　环境要求\nａ)　海拔不超过2500ｍ；\nｂ)　环境温度：-40℃～40℃；\n犌犅／犜13281-2008ｃ)　最大相对湿度：95％(该月平均温度最低为25℃)；\nｄ)　风、沙、雨、雪侵袭.",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "parent_id": 9,
      "unit_hash": "md5:bd9a7a3c3d40d8f03a83c6f618302490",
      "num_prefix": "5.1",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 11,
      "text": "5.2　蓄电池外观及标识",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "parent_id": 9,
      "unit_hash": "md5:c851921f5029e7e71e4961a3e410ad2e",
      "num_prefix": "5.2",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 12,
      "text": "5.2.1　蓄电池外观不得有变形、裂纹、划痕；应清洁无酸液、污迹，且标志清晰.",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 3,
      "parent_id": 11,
      "unit_hash": "md5:a8c59c22d891f72a04a79f993e096d9c",
      "num_prefix": "5.2.1",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 13,
      "text": "5.2.2　蓄电池的正、负极端子极性应有明显的颜色标识，或用永久性符号标出，一般红色表示正极端\n子，黑色或蓝色表示负极端子.",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 3,
      "parent_id": 11,
      "unit_hash": "md5:8aa6465555c5376b5f78b134de80aa51",
      "num_prefix": "5.2.2",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 14,
      "text": "5.2.3　含镉蓄电池应在蓄电池本体明显的位置上明示“含镉产品”.",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 3,
      "parent_id": 11,
      "unit_hash": "md5:13e73c81be524c4eb837ed6ad224bf26",
      "num_prefix": "5.2.3",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 15,
      "text": "5.3　外形尺寸及蓄电池质量\n蓄电池外形尺寸及蓄电池质量应符合表1或用户与制造厂协商规定.",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "parent_id": 9,
      "unit_hash": "md5:e34846b9cc9005ca62cfc71b84f8741c",
      "num_prefix": "5.3",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 16,
      "text": "5.4　开路电压组合一致性\n每组蓄电池单体开路电压值差不大于20ｍＶ(2Ｖ蓄电池)、100ｍＶ(12Ｖ蓄电池).",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "parent_id": 9,
      "unit_hash": "md5:bbfb8fe5a60c4f0265d60029ba1d1fce",
      "num_prefix": "5.4",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 17,
      "text": "5.5　容量及容量组合一致性",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "parent_id": 9,
      "unit_hash": "md5:b8d7567ff805b2e1ffd33ad03752b7f1",
      "num_prefix": "5.5",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 18,
      "text": "5.5.1　蓄电池容量\n按6.7.1试验时，按表2规定进行蓄电池容量试验并达到额定值，其中10ｈ率容量试验在第6项、",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "parent_id": 17,
      "unit_hash": "md5:4030d04c523140da877e0338a44f5f1c",
      "num_prefix": "5.5.1",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 19,
      "text": "第8项、第10项三次试验过程中有一次合格即为合格，试验结果取最大值.极限值见表1.",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 4,
      "parent_id": 18,
      "unit_hash": "md5:d5d261b45a4f29db316c4d69d71ffb06",
      "num_prefix": "第8项",
      "marker_type": "article"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 20,
      "text": "5.5.2　容量组合一致性\n容量组合一致性偏差不大于5％.",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "parent_id": 17,
      "unit_hash": "md5:233514ceafacd7d5895a631b90a5896e",
      "num_prefix": "5.5.2",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 21,
      "text": "5.6　低温容量\n按6.8试验时，低温容量(犆ｄ)和常温容量(犆(10、5、1))的比值犆ｄ／犆(10、5、1)不小于0.40.",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "parent_id": 9,
      "unit_hash": "md5:96953186b7b7fc2af47555173a98a9c6",
      "num_prefix": "5.6",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 22,
      "text": "5.7　大电流放电特性\n按6.9试验时，放电结束后导电部件不应熔化，且电池槽不能有大于2ｍｍ的变形及漏液.",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "parent_id": 9,
      "unit_hash": "md5:a6621eb91fc3db13f9a9816d345d86a7",
      "num_prefix": "5.7",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 23,
      "text": "5.8　荷电保持能力\n按6.10试验时，完全充电的蓄电池放置28ｄ后，其容量保存率犚不应低于96％.",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "parent_id": 9,
      "unit_hash": "md5:d00f0fd847d15a86b2baade6c2818cdd",
      "num_prefix": "5.8",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 24,
      "text": "5.9　充电接受能力\n按6.11试验时，蓄电池所能接受的充电电流值，不小于1.4犐10(Ａ).",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "parent_id": 9,
      "unit_hash": "md5:5c4367af0bc2007252c7e8109d8badf5",
      "num_prefix": "5.9",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 25,
      "text": "5.10　过充电性能\n按6.12试验时，试验完成后侧面不应有大于2ｍｍ的变形及漏液.",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "parent_id": 9,
      "unit_hash": "md5:ddb7e67bd764057df4aa2093ff820725",
      "num_prefix": "5.10",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 26,
      "text": "5.11　循环耐久能力\n按6.13试验时，当其容量达到0.85犆10(Ａｈ)(2Ｖ蓄电池)、0.65犆10(Ａｈ)(12Ｖ蓄电池)时，所获得的循环次数不应低于6个单元(180次循环).",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "parent_id": 9,
      "unit_hash": "md5:3698872f15fba3b17d14e4eba9683a4c",
      "num_prefix": "5.11",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 27,
      "text": "5.12　密封反应效率\n按6.14试验时，密封反应效率η不小于90％.",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "parent_id": 9,
      "unit_hash": "md5:34e5a5f89ee56e1bc15e6f42528d5e8b",
      "num_prefix": "5.12",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 28,
      "text": "5.13　防爆能力\n按6.15试验时，当外部遇明火时其内部不应发生燃烧或爆炸.",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "parent_id": 9,
      "unit_hash": "md5:3091c5f2128cab06b48700c4fc10a554",
      "num_prefix": "5.13",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 29,
      "text": "5.14　防酸雾能力\n按6.16试验时，充电电量每1Ａｈ析出的酸雾量不应大于0.025ｍｇ.",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "parent_id": 9,
      "unit_hash": "md5:81898e98947e8302192b8b2aec54849d",
      "num_prefix": "5.14",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 30,
      "text": "5.15　排气阀性能\n按6.17试验时，排气阀应在1ｋＰａ～49ｋＰａ范围内可靠地开启和关闭.",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "parent_id": 9,
      "unit_hash": "md5:295ce2184fdbfff1fafe6b6ec0a45461",
      "num_prefix": "5.15",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 31,
      "text": "5.16　气密性\n按6.18试验时，除安全阀外，其他各处要保持良好的气密性，并应能承受55ｋＰａ的压力，且持续时间不小于30ｓ，蓄电池所有部位不得出现泄漏.压力释放后，蓄电池无残余变形.",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "parent_id": 9,
      "unit_hash": "md5:ca68266df9438f48d3169a07ecf38575",
      "num_prefix": "5.16",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 32,
      "text": "5.17　振动试验\n按6.19试验时，不损坏并保持额定容量.\n犌犅／犜13281-2008",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "parent_id": 9,
      "unit_hash": "md5:915e81dab2bc96dcb64886b654bf7f4c",
      "num_prefix": "5.17",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 33,
      "text": "6　试验方法",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "parent_id": 0,
      "unit_hash": "md5:259159b32cb864643c0876cc3e00f20d",
      "num_prefix": "6",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 34,
      "text": "6.1　测量仪器",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "parent_id": 33,
      "unit_hash": "md5:f7a83050eed1fb7065a09af1b909c374",
      "num_prefix": "6.1",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 35,
      "text": "6.1.1　电气测量",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "parent_id": 34,
      "unit_hash": "md5:68350face0e08cc798eb5db9da136775",
      "num_prefix": "6.1.1",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 36,
      "text": "6.1.1.1　电压测量\n测量电压用的仪表其精度不应低于0.5级，其内阻至少为1000Ω／Ｖ.也可采用数字电压表测量.",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "parent_id": 35,
      "unit_hash": "md5:c47bb0fc333e01943db9fe76a85c50d1",
      "num_prefix": "6.1.1.1",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 37,
      "text": "6.1.1.2　电流测量\n测量电流用的仪表其精度不应低于0.5级.",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "parent_id": 35,
      "unit_hash": "md5:0db70657193670191096bdc574671676",
      "num_prefix": "6.1.1.2",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 38,
      "text": "6.1.2　温度测量\n测量温度用的温度计应具有适当的量程.其分度值不应大于1℃，温度计的标定精度应不低于0.5℃.",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "parent_id": 34,
      "unit_hash": "md5:03ef09e7605647ce1f30cac7474d2cb6",
      "num_prefix": "6.1.2",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 39,
      "text": "6.1.3　时间测量\n测量时间用的仪表应按ｈ、ｍｉｎ、ｓ分度.至少应具有每小时±1ｓ的精度.",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "parent_id": 34,
      "unit_hash": "md5:8d67d9b707661c6568d19925dbb0f30a",
      "num_prefix": "6.1.3",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 40,
      "text": "6.1.4　尺寸测量\n测量蓄电池外形尺寸的量具精度应不低于±0.2ｍｍ.",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "parent_id": 34,
      "unit_hash": "md5:d8ab262bb2b54f7382d7de5aa1955105",
      "num_prefix": "6.1.4",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 41,
      "text": "6.1.5　质量称量\n称量蓄电池质量的衡器，精度不应低于±0.05％.",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "parent_id": 34,
      "unit_hash": "md5:e42ca8383ca52530b4c587fc82b64587",
      "num_prefix": "6.1.5",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 42,
      "text": "6.1.6　压力测量\n测量压力用仪表其精度不应低于0.5级.",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "parent_id": 34,
      "unit_hash": "md5:9259438fba112fed9659a2af11015aab",
      "num_prefix": "6.1.6",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 43,
      "text": "6.1.7　容积测量\n测量容积的量筒或滴定管应具有±1％以上的精度.",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "parent_id": 34,
      "unit_hash": "md5:144736c16e763331ddbee238f383b584",
      "num_prefix": "6.1.7",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 44,
      "text": "6.2　试验前的预处理",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "parent_id": 33,
      "unit_hash": "md5:148ec3435a44251698ed48095ada2cd3",
      "num_prefix": "6.2",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 45,
      "text": "6.2.1　试验应在蓄电池生产后的6个月内进行，试验前所有蓄电池必须进行完全充电.",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 3,
      "parent_id": 44,
      "unit_hash": "md5:cde38c0b890996233bfdd3bb82085d83",
      "num_prefix": "6.2.1",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 46,
      "text": "6.2.2　蓄电池的完全充电\n在温度为25℃±5℃的环境中，以单格电压为2.35Ｖ～2.40Ｖ进行充电，时间不低于20ｈ.充电电流不应超过3犐10(Ａ).在充电末期3ｈ内，电流无明显变化时则认为已完全充电.",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "parent_id": 44,
      "unit_hash": "md5:e72b752941e3e82f6f26c29d72083ea6",
      "num_prefix": "6.2.2",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 47,
      "text": "6.2.3　按制造商提供的完全充电方法充电.",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 3,
      "parent_id": 44,
      "unit_hash": "md5:ac799aa9ab7888ad78a28b8110da532c",
      "num_prefix": "6.2.3",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 48,
      "text": "6.3　外观检查\n用目视检查蓄电池的外观.",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "parent_id": 33,
      "unit_hash": "md5:bcbaea491f2b444701e483520086a1ab",
      "num_prefix": "6.3",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 49,
      "text": "6.4　尺寸检查\n按图2所示的结构尺寸测量蓄电池的外形尺寸.",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "parent_id": 33,
      "unit_hash": "md5:8ad5889aefb66c7dc1d58e1dd18103fb",
      "num_prefix": "6.4",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 50,
      "text": "6.5　质量检查\n擦净蓄电池表面，用符合精度的衡器称量蓄电池的质量.",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "parent_id": 33,
      "unit_hash": "md5:485eee189ff5d9eb88e0c45f9e140f13",
      "num_prefix": "6.5",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 51,
      "text": "6.6　开路电压组合一致性\n任选四只蓄电池，用电压表测量蓄电池的极柱根部，测得开路电压的差值.\nΔ犝＝犞ｍａｘ-犞ｍｉｎ……………………………(1)式中：\nΔ犝---每组蓄电池单体开路电压差的数值，单位为伏特(Ｖ)；\n犞ｍａｘ---开路电压最大值的数值，单位为伏特(Ｖ)；\n犞ｍｉｎ---开路电压最小值的数值，单位为伏特(Ｖ).",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "parent_id": 33,
      "unit_hash": "md5:43f05cf1734186b6cf2f3a7f38ac4513",
      "num_prefix": "6.6",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 52,
      "text": "6.7　容量试验及容量组合一致性",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "parent_id": 33,
      "unit_hash": "md5:43193f63e2036bbe71dc84dd92ec960e",
      "num_prefix": "6.7",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 53,
      "text": "6.7.1　容量试验\n容量犆10ａ(Ａｈ)、犆5ａ(Ａｈ)、犆1ａ(Ａｈ)试验应在完全充电的蓄电池上进行，将完全充电的蓄电池在犌犅／犜13281-200825℃±5℃环境中静置1ｈ～24ｈ后，分别以犐10(Ａ)、犐5(Ａ)、犐1(Ａ)的恒电流放电，在放电过程中，放电电流的波动不得超过规定值的±1％.直至蓄电池的端电压降至表1所规定的终止电压时停止试验，同时记录放电时间犜和蓄电池表面平均温度.\n放电时，若蓄电池表面平均温度不是25℃，蓄电池的实际容量应按下式换算：\n犆ａ＝犆ｔ1＋λ(狋-25)……………………………(2)犆ｔ＝犜× (犐10、犐5、犐1)……………………………(3)式中：\n犆ａ---换算为标准温度25℃时的容量的数值，单位为安时(Ａｈ)；\n犆ｔ---平均温度为狋℃时的容量的数值，单位为安时(Ａｈ)；\n狋---放电开始至放电终止时的平均温度的数值，单位为摄氏度(℃)；\n犜---放电时间犜的数值，单位为小时(ｈ)；\n犐10、犐5、犐1---放电电流的数值，单位为安培(Ａ)；\nλ---温度系数，单位为每摄氏度(1／℃)；\n10ｈｒ容量试验时，λ＝0.006；\n5ｈｒ容量试验时，λ＝0.008；\n1ｈｒ容量试验时，λ＝0.010.\n公式(2)适用于15℃～40℃温度范围.",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "parent_id": 52,
      "unit_hash": "md5:3b16638b9842b7415b4fd167326b5b89",
      "num_prefix": "6.7.1",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 54,
      "text": "6.7.2　容量组合一致性\nΔ犆(10、5、1)ａ＝犆(10、5、1)ａｍａｘ-犆(10、5、1)ａｍｉｎ犆(10、5、1)ａｍｅａｎ×100％……………………(4)式中：\nΔ犆(10、5、1)ａ---容量组合一致性，数值以％表示；\n犆(10、5、1)ａｍａｘ---蓄电池犆(10、5、1)ａ最大容量的数值，单位为安时(Ａｈ)；\n犆(10、5、1)ａｍｉｎ---蓄电池犆(10、5、1)ａ最小容量的数值，单位为安时(Ａｈ)；\n犆(10、5、1)ａｍｅａｎ---蓄电池犆(10、5、1)ａ平均容量的数值，单位为安时(Ａｈ).",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "parent_id": 52,
      "unit_hash": "md5:8c440eecfbdf9d27d0c406df90dad592",
      "num_prefix": "6.7.2",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 55,
      "text": "6.7.3　试验后的蓄电池应进行完全充电.",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 3,
      "parent_id": 52,
      "unit_hash": "md5:a3e00fafec51f21cf3fb03108c4759de",
      "num_prefix": "6.7.3",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 56,
      "text": "6.8　低温容量\n经容量试验合格的蓄电池进行完全充电后，置于-40℃±1℃的低温箱或低温室内保持8ｈ，在此温度下按表1以犐10(Ａ)恒定电流放电至终止电压1.60Ｖ(2Ｖ蓄电池)、9.60Ｖ(12Ｖ蓄电池)时记录放电时间，精确到ｓ，并计算实测容量.\n试验后的蓄电池应进行完全充电.",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "parent_id": 33,
      "unit_hash": "md5:156c2ad23e5733e11f4b5138bbf2268f",
      "num_prefix": "6.8",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 57,
      "text": "6.9　大电流放电特性\n经容量试验合格的蓄电池进行完全充电后，在环境温度25℃±5℃下，静止1ｈ～24ｈ.以最大放电电流犐ｓ［3犆10(Ａ)］进行放电，时间为3ｍｉｎ.",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "parent_id": 33,
      "unit_hash": "md5:fe71cb47eb15b3b96de8fa81a4ad2550",
      "num_prefix": "6.9",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 58,
      "text": "6.10　荷电保持能力试验",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "parent_id": 33,
      "unit_hash": "md5:d60839fac7a0b8c444a1efdcccfc16f1",
      "num_prefix": "6.10",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 59,
      "text": "6.10.1　蓄电池经过完全充电后，按6.7.1规定，以表2第10项试验的容量数值作为贮存前的实际\n容量.",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 3,
      "parent_id": 58,
      "unit_hash": "md5:ed5bdbe17f827302ce5b2d95f3a2a548",
      "num_prefix": "6.10.1",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 60,
      "text": "6.10.2　再次完全充电后，擦净表面，在25℃±2℃相对湿度不大于80％的环境中贮存28ｄ.",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 3,
      "parent_id": 58,
      "unit_hash": "md5:907cd0f6ee33f21748c6e459848a55dd",
      "num_prefix": "6.10.2",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 61,
      "text": "6.10.3　贮存期满后不充电按照6.7.1进行容量试验.",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 3,
      "parent_id": 58,
      "unit_hash": "md5:f1a739376b7fbb8bfb3154becc34b543",
      "num_prefix": "6.10.3",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 62,
      "text": "6.10.4　荷电保持能力犚按下式计算\n犚＝犆ｈ犆ａ×100％…………………………(5)犌犅／犜13281-2008式中：\n犚---荷电保持能力，％；\n犆ｈ---贮存后的实际容量的数值，单位为安时(Ａｈ)；\n犆ａ---贮存前的实际容量的数值，单位为安时(Ａｈ).",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "parent_id": 58,
      "unit_hash": "md5:be6a2b84b625681e847c65c4d8d9f871",
      "num_prefix": "6.10.4",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 63,
      "text": "6.10.5　贮存前的实际容量小于额定容量的蓄电池不再进行荷电保持能力试验.",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 3,
      "parent_id": 58,
      "unit_hash": "md5:54146ea696dcaf71e1a261de5368b42a",
      "num_prefix": "6.10.5",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 64,
      "text": "6.11　充电接受能力",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "parent_id": 33,
      "unit_hash": "md5:969e03c09f7051c96d42c66a31ffcfc0",
      "num_prefix": "6.11",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 65,
      "text": "6.11.1　完全充电的蓄电池在温度为25℃±5℃的环境中以犐10(Ａ)电流放出实际容量(以表2第10\n项容量试验值为此次试验的实际容量)的50％后，立即送入0℃±1℃的低温箱内保持8ｈ(整个过程应在48ｈ内完成).",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 3,
      "parent_id": 64,
      "unit_hash": "md5:6d0ff854606528192c6dc8af51ca132d",
      "num_prefix": "6.11.1",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 66,
      "text": "6.11.2　蓄电池在低温室内或者从低温箱取出3ｍｉｎ内，2Ｖ蓄电池以2.40Ｖ±0.02Ｖ、12Ｖ蓄电池\n以14.40Ｖ±0.10Ｖ定电压充电10ｍｉｎ时，记录蓄电池所接受的充电电流值犐ｃａ.",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 3,
      "parent_id": 64,
      "unit_hash": "md5:fa525f0f9d59eb1c6926e92874f042ea",
      "num_prefix": "6.11.2",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 67,
      "text": "6.12　过充电性能\n经容量试验合格的蓄电池在试验环境温度为25℃±5℃下，用0.3犐10(Ａ)恒定电流进行连续充电160ｈ.充电终止后静置1ｈ，目视检查蓄电池外观.",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "parent_id": 33,
      "unit_hash": "md5:8473cae1c00177fe75eae6d001a7f85e",
      "num_prefix": "6.12",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 68,
      "text": "6.13　循环耐久能力",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "parent_id": 33,
      "unit_hash": "md5:fa00e2cc657617118adca6381110ce5c",
      "num_prefix": "6.13",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 69,
      "text": "6.13.1　经过容量试验、低温容量试验合格的蓄电池进行循环耐久能力试验.",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 3,
      "parent_id": 68,
      "unit_hash": "md5:a70b4df74a38fa97b62c4dece80819e8",
      "num_prefix": "6.13.1",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 70,
      "text": "6.13.2　循环耐久能力试验应在温度25℃±5℃环境下进行.",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 3,
      "parent_id": 68,
      "unit_hash": "md5:ad1baf22b41f036e5fbd16b1981fe6a7",
      "num_prefix": "6.13.2",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 71,
      "text": "6.13.3　将完全充电的蓄电池接到一个恒流恒压循环试验机上，以1ｈｒ的放电电流犐1(Ａ)放电1ｈ，然\n后以单格2.40Ｖ恒压，2Ｖ蓄电池限流2.20犐10(Ａ)、12Ｖ蓄电池限流2.50犐10(Ａ)充电4ｈ为1个循环.",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 3,
      "parent_id": 68,
      "unit_hash": "md5:f797f0b099e0d54615aaabd0d252290b",
      "num_prefix": "6.13.3",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 72,
      "text": "6.13.4　每30次循环后进行一次10ｈｒ容量试验.在循环耐久能力试验期间，2Ｖ蓄电池容量小于\n0.85犆10(Ａｈ)、12Ｖ蓄电池容量小于0.65犆10(Ａｈ)时，结束循环耐久能力试验.其循环次数不计入循环耐久能力.",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 3,
      "parent_id": 68,
      "unit_hash": "md5:4542c64a8f697fef03f6c72e746903ba",
      "num_prefix": "6.13.4",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 73,
      "text": "6.14　密封反应效率试验",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "parent_id": 33,
      "unit_hash": "md5:c48125a855dfcc5ecf41db1630610927",
      "num_prefix": "6.14",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 74,
      "text": "6.14.1　按6.7.1试验后的蓄电池在环境温度为25℃±5℃下，以单格2.25Ｖ(2Ｖ蓄电池限流\n2.20犐10(Ａ)、12Ｖ蓄电池限流2.50犐10(Ａ))恒压充电72ｈ，记录蓄电池电压值并检查蓄电池封合处有无电解液泄漏.充电72ｈ后在充电状态下按图3所示方法持续192ｈ收集气体.测量并记录192ｈ内收集的气体总量犞(ｍＬ)，在气体收集期间，每天测记一次环境温度(℃)和环境大气压力(ｋＰａ).装置见图3.\n图3　收集气体示意图",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 3,
      "parent_id": 73,
      "unit_hash": "md5:cca72d326e8227a4eab0b83b8cf66648",
      "num_prefix": "6.14.1",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 75,
      "text": "6.14.2　密封反应效率的计算\n按6.14.1试验，收集排出的气体量，按公式(6)换算为25℃、101.3ｋＰａ下通过每1Ａｈ电量的气体排出量，按公式(7)计算出密封反应效率.\n犌犅／犜13281-2008犝＝犘犘0×(狋＋273)×犞犙× 1狀……………………………(6)式中：\n犝---25℃、101.3ｋＰａ条件下蓄电池充入1Ａｈ电量所放出的气体量的数值，单位为毫升每安时(ｍＬ／Ａｈ)；\n犘---收集气体期间的环境平均大气压力，单位为千帕(ｋＰａ)；\n犘0---101.3ｋＰａ；\n狋---收集气体期间的环境平均温度的数值，单位为摄氏度(℃)；\n犞---收集的排出气体量的数值，单位为毫升(ｍＬ)；\n犙---收集气体期间通过的电量的数值，单位为安时(Ａｈ)；\n狀---单体蓄电池数；\n273---绝对温标，单位为Ｋ；\n298---［25＋273］，单位为Ｋ.\nη＝1-犝()684×100％……………………………(7)式中：\nη ---密封反应效率，％；\n684---25℃、101.3ｋＰａ条件下蓄电池充入1Ａｈ电量理论气体发生量的数值，单位为毫升(ｍＬ).",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "parent_id": 73,
      "unit_hash": "md5:926a47ef3c179f0142b7d3c5bebbc7d0",
      "num_prefix": "6.14.2",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 76,
      "text": "6.15　防爆能力试验\n防爆能力试验是在确认安全性得以确保之后，对完全充电的蓄电池用0.5犐10(Ａ)恒流进行充电1ｈ后在排气部位附近2ｍｍ～4ｍｍ持续发生火花进行试验，反复二次，火花的大小以24Ｖ直流电源熔断2Ａ保险丝时所产生的结果或同等以上结果为准.",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "parent_id": 33,
      "unit_hash": "md5:01008bf79bb06e06e22b1098dbb8841c",
      "num_prefix": "6.15",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 77,
      "text": "6.16　防酸雾能力试验",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "parent_id": 33,
      "unit_hash": "md5:d73f4672c29a4b54b22795ebe50e29aa",
      "num_prefix": "6.16",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 78,
      "text": "6.16.1　完全充电的蓄电池用0.5犐10(Ａ)的电流，继续充电2ｈ后开始收集气体.",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 3,
      "parent_id": 77,
      "unit_hash": "md5:bbeee5aa5397bfaf04329ab12199a391",
      "num_prefix": "6.16.1",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 79,
      "text": "6.16.2　用图4所示方法将三只分别装有氢氧化钠溶液和蒸馏水的吸收瓶(500ｍＬ)串联收集气体\n2ｈ.其中第一个吸收瓶内装有0.01ｍｏｌ／Ｌ的氢氧化钠溶液25ｍＬ及蒸馏水70ｍＬ；第二、第三个吸收瓶内分别装有蒸馏水50ｍＬ.收集气体时间从溶液中产生气泡开始计时.\n图4　防酸雾性能气体收集装置",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 3,
      "parent_id": 77,
      "unit_hash": "md5:24e7407e901fac71357bfed8b6a5191e",
      "num_prefix": "6.16.2",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 80,
      "text": "6.16.3　将收集气体后的溶液移至500ｍＬ烧杯中，用第二、第三吸收瓶中的溶液依次洗涤第一吸收\n瓶，然后再将三个吸收瓶统一用50ｍＬ蒸馏水洗涤，洗涤液一同并入500ｍＬ烧杯中，加入18～20滴中性红---次甲基兰混合指示剂，然后用0.01ｍｏｌ／Ｌ的盐酸标准溶液滴定至溶液由绿色变为蓝色为终止.",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 3,
      "parent_id": 77,
      "unit_hash": "md5:74c0be2df3d89fa36013ab738cda1315",
      "num_prefix": "6.16.3",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 81,
      "text": "6.16.4　用移液管吸取0.01ｍｏｌ／Ｌ氢氧化钠标准溶液25ｍＬ作空白，加蒸馏水至溶液体积约为\n250ｍＬ，加入18～20滴中性红---次甲基兰混合指示剂，用0.01ｍｏｌ／Ｌ的盐酸标准溶液滴定至溶液犌犅／犜13281-2008由绿色变为蓝色为终止.",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 3,
      "parent_id": 77,
      "unit_hash": "md5:0fa9b126a0c58861369ef453873649d8",
      "num_prefix": "6.16.4",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 82,
      "text": "6.16.5　按式(8)计算酸雾析出量犕ａ(ｍｇ／Ａｈ).\n犕ａ(Ｈ2ＳＯ4)＝(犞0-犞1)×犮×49.040.5犐10×2×狀(ｍｇ／Ａｈ)……………………(8)式中：\n犞0---滴定空白时盐酸标准溶液用量，单位为毫升(ｍＬ)；\n犞1---滴定试样时盐酸标准溶液用量，单位为毫升(ｍＬ)；\n犮---盐酸标准溶液的摩尔浓度，单位为摩尔每升(ｍｏｌ／Ｌ)；\n49.04---0.5ｍｏｌＨ2ＳＯ4的质量，单位为毫克摩尔质量(ｍｇ／ｍｏｌ)；\n2---充电时间，单位为小时(ｈ)；\n狀---单体蓄电池数.",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 3,
      "parent_id": 77,
      "unit_hash": "md5:798467b406b5cb68106db8af6975a205",
      "num_prefix": "6.16.5",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 83,
      "text": "6.17　排气阀性能试验",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "parent_id": 33,
      "unit_hash": "md5:3d99287449b4dd165c3637bf5b95dd0e",
      "num_prefix": "6.17",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 84,
      "text": "6.17.1　排气阀性能试验\n按图5，先读取Ｕ形汞柱压力计的平衡位刻度值，启动气泵，将压力控制在1个大气压力，缓慢打开侧的刻度值.",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "parent_id": 83,
      "unit_hash": "md5:d581046ebd85907ccde39cc4ad069a16",
      "num_prefix": "6.17.1",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 85,
      "text": "6.17.2　开阀压力、闭阀压力的计算\n开阀压力：犘Ｋ＝(犘1-犘0)×2×0.1332　(ｋＰａ)……………………(9)闭阀压力：犘Ｂ＝(犘2-犘0)×2×0.1332　(ｋＰａ)…………………(10)式中：\n犘0---平衡位汞柱刻度值的数值，单位为毫米(ｍｍ)；\n犘1---开阀时汞柱刻度值的数值，单位为毫米(ｍｍ)；\n犘2---闭阀时汞柱刻度值的数值，单位为毫米(ｍｍ)；\n0.1332---1ｍｍ汞柱(Ｈｇ)压力值，单位为千帕(ｋＰａ).\n图5　开闭阀压力测试系统图",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "parent_id": 83,
      "unit_hash": "md5:77b73bc9a085a7b97ada771e9711cc21",
      "num_prefix": "6.17.2",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 86,
      "text": "6.18　气密性试验\n向蓄电池内部注入气体，逐渐增大压力，当压力为55ｋＰａ时，压力表的读数应持续30ｓ不变，压力释放后，蓄电池无残余变形.",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "parent_id": 33,
      "unit_hash": "md5:c341d24e52351c64776c47337b307e9c",
      "num_prefix": "6.18",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 87,
      "text": "6.19　振动试验",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "parent_id": 33,
      "unit_hash": "md5:1c2de688e5b47db7f5d1e7f6b3df6ebb",
      "num_prefix": "6.19",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 88,
      "text": "6.19.1　振动试验应在已达到额定容量并在完全充电的蓄电池上进行.\n犌犅／犜13281-2008",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 3,
      "parent_id": 87,
      "unit_hash": "md5:c70f149e2bc0dd578b950dac0270e67d",
      "num_prefix": "6.19.1",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 89,
      "text": "6.19.2　将蓄电池放在振动台面上，用专用卡具固定.",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 3,
      "parent_id": 87,
      "unit_hash": "md5:42970da01b43959abb5429b6e8b71da4",
      "num_prefix": "6.19.2",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 90,
      "text": "6.19.3　蓄电池在频率70次±2次／ｍｉｎ、振幅为10ｍｍ±1ｍｍ的情况下做自由落体振动.振动3ｈ\n后，检查蓄电池表面，不应有变形和损坏，然后做蓄电池容量试验.",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 3,
      "parent_id": 87,
      "unit_hash": "md5:a01f876d88bcc1fd0c60d511544257af",
      "num_prefix": "6.19.3",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 91,
      "text": "6.19.4　做过振动试验的蓄电池不再做其他试验.",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 3,
      "parent_id": 87,
      "unit_hash": "md5:9de5101eec7259f7002b4f4ce0f9546a",
      "num_prefix": "6.19.4",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 92,
      "text": "7　检验规则",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "parent_id": 0,
      "unit_hash": "md5:b1d43a7436afdb17df05c53504efa075",
      "num_prefix": "7",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 93,
      "text": "7.1　检验分类\n检验分为出厂检验、周期检验和型式检验.",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "parent_id": 92,
      "unit_hash": "md5:5b098d0ff79e66d93d20792afb5e6953",
      "num_prefix": "7.1",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 94,
      "text": "7.1.1　出厂检验、周期检验\n表3.",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "parent_id": 93,
      "unit_hash": "md5:d9829533107bf6c3ab41b44957df4d34",
      "num_prefix": "7.1.1",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 95,
      "text": "7.1.2　型式检验\n遇有下列情况之一时，应抽样进行型式检验，作型式检验必须是经出厂检验合格的产品.\nａ)　试制的新产品；\nｂ)　产品结构、工艺配方或原材料有更改时；\nｃ)　批量生产的产品按表5规定进行的定期抽样检验；\nｄ)　用户要求的检验；\nｅ)　政府行为的检验.\n同系列蓄电池型式检验时一般选取产量最大的型号抽样.",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "parent_id": 93,
      "unit_hash": "md5:5ac1775ea75245b58242b4830d96e3ff",
      "num_prefix": "7.1.2",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 96,
      "text": "7.2　型式检验项目与全项试验程序见表2.\n表2　型式试验项目与全项试验程序序号检验分类试验数量试验周期出厂检验外观(镉明示)全数尺寸1％质量1％全数周期检验低温容量防爆能力振动试验6只1只每月一次3月一次3月一次半年一次半年一次半年一次半年一次半年一次半年一次半年一次每年一次半年一次每年一次犌犅／犜13281-2008",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 2,
      "parent_id": 92,
      "unit_hash": "md5:de0e5cef02de93da59bf5fcc436f1a5c",
      "num_prefix": "7.2",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 97,
      "text": "7.3　出厂检验和周期检验项目、样品数量和检验周期见表3.\n表3　出厂检验和周期检验项目、样品数量和检验周期序号外观(镉明示)√√√√√√尺寸√√√√√√√质量√√√√√√√10ｈ率容量试验√√√√√√5ｈ率容量试验及容量组合一致性√√√√√√10ｈ率容量试验√√√√√√1ｈ率容量试验及容量组合一致性√√√√√√10ｈ率容量试验及容量组合一致性√√√√√√低温容量√√√√√√√√√√√√√√防爆能力√振动试验√注：“√”为确定测试标志.",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 2,
      "parent_id": 92,
      "unit_hash": "md5:001a3b6d25bcd418cf06923fc96a6270",
      "num_prefix": "7.3",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 98,
      "text": "7.4　检验判定准则",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "parent_id": 92,
      "unit_hash": "md5:e57cac9358aba3be874afd3cdbe67220",
      "num_prefix": "7.4",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 99,
      "text": "7.4.1　依检验现象评定的检验项目，以检验现象进行判定.",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 3,
      "parent_id": 98,
      "unit_hash": "md5:2f00cb9b243e9386389fe69d81887e18",
      "num_prefix": "7.4.1",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 100,
      "text": "7.4.2　依检验数据评定的检验项目，以全部参试蓄电池的测试数据作为该项目的判定数据，若有一只\n合格.",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 3,
      "parent_id": 98,
      "unit_hash": "md5:eb1c1b718abe5995d0e4c053662b64c8",
      "num_prefix": "7.4.2",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 101,
      "text": "7.5　产品检验合格后方可出厂，并附有产品检验合格的文件.",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 2,
      "parent_id": 92,
      "unit_hash": "md5:9b7b96dda5a7680ad552042ca4d2e886",
      "num_prefix": "7.5",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 102,
      "text": "8　标志、包装、运输、贮存",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "parent_id": 0,
      "unit_hash": "md5:95b5dc31b0a8b066cb6751fe6800902f",
      "num_prefix": "8",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 103,
      "text": "8.1　标志",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "parent_id": 102,
      "unit_hash": "md5:3c644d4bd76d07a1c2dfe1dc95abd5ed",
      "num_prefix": "8.1",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 104,
      "text": "8.1.1　蓄电池产品上应有下列标志：\nａ)　制造厂名；\nｂ)　产品型号或规格；\nｃ)　制造日期；\n犌犅／犜13281-2008犌犅／犜13281-2008ｄ)　商标；\nｅ)　极性符号；\nｆ)　环保标志；\nｇ)　含镉(无镉)标志.",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 3,
      "parent_id": 103,
      "unit_hash": "md5:416987c3be45f97540b93dbea90c7af7",
      "num_prefix": "8.1.1",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 105,
      "text": "8.1.2　包装箱外壁应有下列标志：\nａ)　产品名称、型号规格、数量；\nｂ)　产品标准编号；\nｃ)　每箱的净重及毛重；\nｄ)　标明防潮、不准倒置、轻放等字样；\nｅ)　厂名、厂址.",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 3,
      "parent_id": 103,
      "unit_hash": "md5:65fbf03e65f3563b0319f404cb6a16ec",
      "num_prefix": "8.1.2",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 106,
      "text": "8.2　包装",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "parent_id": 102,
      "unit_hash": "md5:c411c0e5e2d14fe49b0c4fbe78bfe27a",
      "num_prefix": "8.2",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 107,
      "text": "8.2.1　蓄电池的包装应符合防潮、防振的要求.",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 3,
      "parent_id": 106,
      "unit_hash": "md5:1ab5ecad19f5ed1a8d5195a6513ce4f0",
      "num_prefix": "8.2.1",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 108,
      "text": "8.2.2　包装箱内应装入随同产品供应的文件\nａ)　装箱单；\nｂ)　产品合格证明；\nｃ)　产品使用说明书.",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "parent_id": 106,
      "unit_hash": "md5:73b352c167e9ed92b2c167bbe313102d",
      "num_prefix": "8.2.2",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 109,
      "text": "8.3　运输",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "parent_id": 102,
      "unit_hash": "md5:479a2e1f846aec247892980d76d3c2d2",
      "num_prefix": "8.3",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 110,
      "text": "8.3.1　在运输过程中，产品不得受剧烈机械冲撞、曝晒、雨淋、不得倒置.",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 3,
      "parent_id": 109,
      "unit_hash": "md5:d806da648e3444d60dbd7986d44273a9",
      "num_prefix": "8.3.1",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 111,
      "text": "8.3.2　在装卸过程中，产品应轻放，严防摔掷翻滚、重压.",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 3,
      "parent_id": 109,
      "unit_hash": "md5:128a8bb162ab323786c114efb9f32a61",
      "num_prefix": "8.3.2",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 112,
      "text": "8.4　贮存",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
