    },
    {
      "unit_id": 113,
      "text": "8.4.1　产品应贮存在温度为5℃～40℃的干燥，清洁及通风良好的仓库内.",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 3,
      "parent_id": 112,
      "unit_hash": "md5:77b091e545b63991b0ea7f0c7efc6930",
      "num_prefix": "8.4.1",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 114,
      "text": "8.4.2　不应受阳光直射，离热源(暖气设备等)不得少于2ｍ.",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 3,
      "parent_id": 112,
      "unit_hash": "md5:733d39cb4f8c8ec97b410bb3387edc85",
      "num_prefix": "8.4.2",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 115,
      "text": "8.4.3　不得倒置及卧放，不得受任何机械冲击或重压.",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 3,
      "parent_id": 112,
      "unit_hash": "md5:e32aef5ec62bcff1a9e9f2107613ef5b",
      "num_prefix": "8.4.3",
      "marker_type": "decimal"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": 116,
      "text": "8.5　使用时的注意事项\nａ)　蓄电池不得短路；\nｂ)　蓄电池不得放置在密闭的容器内；\nｃ)　蓄电池远离火源；\nｄ)　充电时注意事项；\nｅ)　蓄电池破损时的处理方法；\nｆ)　不得随意解剖.\n-犜／犅犌",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "parent_id": 102,
      "unit_hash": "md5:5886f332c8061ecd85846eee3ec47d1c",
      "num_prefix": "8.5",
